    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nNo. 5 The Elms is a beautifully presented two-bedroom ground-floor apartment in excellent condition throughout, situated within the highly sought-after Diamond Valley development in Bray. Bright, spacious and stylishly upgraded, the property benefits from modern bathrooms, a recently upgraded gas boiler, contemporary fitted appliance and an impressive south-west-facing wrap-around balcony.\n\nThe accommodation is well proportioned and thoughtfully laid out. An inviting entrance hallway leads through to a bright and spacious open-plan living and dining area, where a wall of windows provides an abundance of natural light and creates a wonderful connection with the outdoor space. The living area opens directly onto the generous wrap-around balcony, which extends around the apartment to one of the double bedrooms. With its desirable south-west-facing aspect, the balcony is ideally positioned to enjoy afternoon and evening sunshine and provides an excellent outdoor space for relaxing or entertaining.\n\nThe kitchen is fitted with a full range of modern integrated appliances, all of which are no more than three years old. There are two generous double bedrooms with fitted wardrobes, including a main bedroom with ensuite. Both the main bathroom and ensuite have been upgraded and are fully tiled, with sleek, stylish contemporary finishes. The apartment also benefits from an upgraded gas boiler and has been exceptionally well maintained, leaving it in excellent condition for its new owners.\n\nThe Diamond Valley development offers secure underground parking accessed through electronic gates, with lift access directly to the apartment blocks. There are also gated pedestrian entrances and attractive communal gardens surrounding the development, providing residents with pleasant landscaped amenity space.\n\nThe location is exceptionally convenient, positioned adjacent to the Dargle Centre and within easy reach of Bray Town Centre and its excellent selection of shops, cafés, supermarkets, restaurants, schools, sports and leisure facilities. Public transport links are readily accessible, including the 185 feeder bus service, while Bray DART station provides regular services to Dublin City Centre and along the coast.\n\nBray's renowned Victorian seafront promenade and harbour are within approximately 2km, while Bray Head, the coastal walk towards Greystones and Killruddery House & Gardens are among the many nearby recreational attractions.\n\nBray is one of South County Dublin and North Wicklow's most popular coastal towns, combining seaside living with excellent amenities and convenient access to Dublin. Situated approximately 20km south of Dublin City Centre, the area is well served by DART and bus services, while the N11/M11/M50 road network is within easy reach.\n\nNo. 5 The Elms represents an excellent opportunity to acquire a stylish, upgraded and exceptionally well-maintained ground-floor apartment, with the added benefit of a superb south-west-facing wrap-around balcony, in a highly convenient Bray location.\n\nKey Points: \n\n• Beautifully presented two-bedroom ground-floor apartment\n• Excellent condition throughout\n• Impressive south-west-facing wrap-around balcony\n• Balcony accessible from both the living area and double bedroom\n• Bright open-plan living/dining area with a wall of windows\n• Two generous double bedrooms with fitted wardrobes\n• Stylish upgraded main bathroom and ensuite, both fully tiled\n• Upgraded gas boiler\n• Modern fitted appliances, all no more than three years old\n• Secure underground parking with lift access to the apartment block"
      },
